  "description": "Stay Strong's refined V5.1 frame. The ultimate aluminium BMX race frame. This is the Expert (19.5\" Top tube) frame and features a 1-1/8th head tube, Euro bottom bracket and 10mm enclosed dropouts for for Disc brakes and a 22.2mm seat tube all allowing you to run the very best and modern conponentry. The frame is a refinement of Stay Strong's race winning aluminium frame design. The main addition to the V5.1 is a stiffer and stronger down tube, allowing a \"Pro\" size look and feel but without compromising on the weight or design. With every new frame come new and improved water decals and logos. With the V5.1 being no exception... Check out the new premium finishes spliiting colours across both sides of the frame all tied in with new colour matched water graphics . The For Life V5.1 from Stay Strong is one of the best performing and looking BMX race frames out there.",
